      "message": "drive-by comment: I believe my changes (soong: aosp/3184953, llvm: aosp/3195596) is responsible for the presubmit failures observed here. (sorry for the breakage)\n\n- The soong CL stack switched the build rules to link against stubs generated from symbol files instead of the checked-in so files. \n- The LLVM CL modified the mapfile.py gen script to add `#systemapi` annotations to the symbol files of libclang_rt libs\n\nHowever, this annotation should only be used for platform libraries, otherwise the symbols will be missing in the generated stub files. This value is not correct for `libclang_rt.hwasan`, since it is part of [runtime apex](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/bionic/+/ce87f19bc5c12b6fed301517257194c41d7cf204:apex/Android.bp;l\u003d48;drc\u003dd13ca8d06a1acbfac60b275e6d5026a5116fbd45;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0) for 64 bit builds",
